---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
---

<InfoPage
  lang="en"
  title="About Us"
  heading="About ToolsOfTools"
  description="Learn about ToolsOfTools, our mission to build transparent, client-side, privacy-focused calculators and utilities."
>
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <p>
      Welcome to <strong>ToolsOfTools</strong>. Our mission is to provide fast, completely private, and highly accessible utilities and calculators for everyday mathematical, financial, engineering, and unit conversion problems.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Zero Data Collection</h2>
    <p>
      Unlike traditional web utilities that upload your numbers to external servers or track your inputs with third-party tracking scripts, ToolsOfTools executes 100% of calculations right inside your browser. No forms submitted, no server logging, and no personal data stored.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Transparent & Open</h2>
    <p>
      Every single tool includes clear formulas, explained worked examples, and source documentation so you can independently verify every result.
    </p>
  </section>
</InfoPage>
